# Unblessed: new regression; first blessing awaits human review.
# Chapters 5/6/8: a parked Run pays dispatch before checking retained state.
# Dropping pays dispatch only and faults at the first body instruction when
# that rate cannot be paid. Replacement leaves earlier Runs intact unless it
# can pay the complete first instruction charge (clause 4 + const 1).
# A dropped Run also checks ending state, including accepted later messages.
